<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the</p>
<p>first day of first class Sheffield Shield matches played on</p>
<p>Thursday:</p>
<p>In Sydney: Tasmania 370-4 (Jamie Cox 143, Ricky Ponting 64)</p>
<p>v New South Wales</p>
<p>In Brisbane: Queensland 277; South Australia 26-3</p>
<p>In Melbourne: Victoria 205-9 (Shawn Craig 90 not out) v</p>
<p>Western Australia.</p>
</text>
